==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[tit]] [[for]] [[tat]]}}

# {{idiom}} [[equivalent]] [[retribution]], [[an eye for an eye]], returning exactly what you get.
#: ''If you hit me, I'll hit you back; '''tit for tat'''.''
# {{Cockney rhyming slang}} [[hat]].

